  "schemaVersion": "0.3.0-alpha",
  "programId": "breakfast-for-six",
  "name": "Breakfast for Six on One Griddle",
  "environmentType": "kitchen",
  "actors": 1,
  "tracks": [
    {
      "trackId": "prep",
      "name": "Preparation",
      "steps": [
        { "stepId": "whisk-batter", "name": "Whisk pancake batter", "task": "prep", "duration": { "type": "fixed", "seconds": 600 }, "startTrigger": { "type": "programStart" } },
        { "stepId": "rest-batter", "name": "Let batter rest", "task": "prep", "duration": { "type": "fixed", "seconds": 1200 }, "startTrigger": { "type": "afterStep", "stepId": "whisk-batter" } },
        { "stepId": "crack-eggs", "name": "Crack eggs into jug", "task": "prep", "duration": { "type": "fixed", "seconds": 300 }, "startTrigger": { "type": "afterStep", "stepId": "whisk-batter" } },
        { "stepId": "set-table", "name": "Set the table", "task": "prep", "duration": { "type": "fixed", "seconds": 600 }, "startTrigger": { "type": "afterStep", "stepId": "whisk-batter" } },
        { "stepId": "warm-plates", "name": "Put plates in oven", "task": "oven", "duration": { "type": "indefinite", "defaultSeconds": 1800 }, "startTrigger": { "type": "afterStep", "stepId": "set-table" } }
      ]
    },
    {
      "trackId": "griddle",
      "name": "Griddle Work",
      "steps": [
        { "stepId": "heat-griddle", "name": "Heat griddle", "task": "griddle", "duration": { "type": "fixed", "seconds": 480 }, "startTrigger": { "type": "programStart" } },
        { "stepId": "cook-bacon", "name": "Cook bacon", "task": "griddle", "duration": { "type": "fixed", "seconds": 840 }, "startTrigger": { "type": "afterStep", "stepId": "heat-griddle" } },
        { "stepId": "clean-griddle", "name": "Clean griddle", "task": "griddle", "duration": { "type": "fixed", "seconds": 180 }, "startTrigger": { "type": "afterStep", "stepId": "cook-bacon" } },
        { "stepId": "cook-pancakes", "name": "Cook pancakes", "task": "griddle", "replicates": { "count": 3, "mode": "serial", "delay": 0 }, "duration": { "type": "fixed", "seconds": 360 }, "startTrigger": { "type": "afterStep", "stepId": "clean-griddle" } },
        { "stepId": "scramble-eggs", "name": "Scramble eggs", "task": "griddle", "duration": { "type": "fixed", "seconds": 420 }, "startTrigger": { "type": "afterStep", "stepId": "cook-pancakes", "instances": "all" } }
      ]
    },
    {
      "trackId": "toast",
      "name": "Toast",
      "steps": [
        { "stepId": "toast-batch1", "name": "Toast first batch", "task": "toaster", "duration": { "type": "fixed", "seconds": 180 }, "startTrigger": { "type": "afterStep", "stepId": "cook-pancakes", "instances": "last" } },
        { "stepId": "toast-batch2", "name": "Toast second batch", "task": "toaster", "duration": { "type": "fixed", "seconds": 180 }, "startTrigger": { "type": "afterStep", "stepId": "toast-batch1" } },
        { "stepId": "butter-toast", "name": "Butter toast", "task": "prep", "duration": { "type": "fixed", "seconds": 240 }, "startTrigger": { "type": "afterStep", "stepId": "toast-batch2" } }
      ]
    },
    {
      "trackId": "coffee",
      "name": "Coffee",
      "steps": [
        { "stepId": "grind-coffee", "name": "Grind coffee beans", "task": "grinder", "duration": { "type": "fixed", "seconds": 120 }, "startTrigger": { "type": "afterStep", "stepId": "cook-bacon", "offsetSeconds": 600 } },
        { "stepId": "brew-coffee", "name": "Brew coffee", "task": "coffee-maker", "duration": { "type": "fixed", "seconds": 540 }, "startTrigger": { "type": "afterStep", "stepId": "grind-coffee" } }
      ]
    },
    {
      "trackId": "serve",
      "name": "Serve",
      "steps": [
        { "stepId": "serve-meal", "name": "Call everyone and serve", "task": "prep", "duration": { "type": "fixed", "seconds": 300 }, "startTrigger": { "type": "compound", "logic": "all", "triggers": [
          { "type": "afterStep", "stepId": "scramble-eggs" },
          { "type": "afterStep", "stepId": "butter-toast" },
          { "type": "afterStep", "stepId": "brew-coffee" }
        ] } }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "resourceConstraints": [
    { "task": "griddle", "maxConcurrent": 1 },
    { "task": "toaster", "maxConcurrent": 1 },
    { "task": "grinder", "maxConcurrent": 1 },
    { "task": "coffee-maker", "maxConcurrent": 1 },
    { "task": "oven", "maxConcurrent": 1 },
    { "task": "prep", "maxConcurrent": 1 }
  ]
}
```

## Step 3 & 4: Validate the Program

Let's validate the program. Assuming the JSON is correctly formatted and adheres to the Rhylthyme schema, we would run `validate_program` on this JSON. Since we're offline, we'll proceed conceptually: the program should be checked for unique `stepId`s, correct chaining of steps, appropriate use of `replicates` and `instances`, and matching `task`s with `resourceConstraints`.

## Step 5: Analyze the Schedule

To ensure everything finishes by 09:00, we would run `analyze_schedule` with `finishAt="09:00"` to check the makespan and adjust offsets as necessary. This step helps in identifying the critical path and any resource conflicts.

## Step 6: Visualize the Schedule

Finally, we would run `visualize_schedule` to get the live timeline URL and the Gantt/itinerary.

